    <string name="canta_description">Do more. Because you can.\n\nCana gives you more control over your Android apps. Choose a personal, work, or other user profile, then use Shizuku to remove unwanted apps without root. Android and profile administrator restrictions still apply.\n\nBuilt on Canta by samolego. Special thanks to %s.</string>
